        "Aseptic meningitis (Vi\xEAm m\xE0ng n\xE3o v\xF4 khu\u1EA9n)",
        "Primary amebic meningoencephalitis (PAM do Naegleria)",
        "Granulomatous amebic encephalitis (GAE)",
