          "H\u1ED9i ch\u1EE9ng r\xE3nh n\u1EBFp b\u1EB9n (Groove Sign) trong LGV: H\u1EA1ch b\u1EA1ch huy\u1EBFt nh\xF3m b\u1EB9n n\xF4ng v\xE0 nh\xF3m \u0111\xF9i s\u01B0ng to b\u1ECB chia c\u1EAFt b\u1EDFi d\xE2y ch\u1EB1ng b\u1EB9n Poupart t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t r\xE3nh l\xF5m ngang \u0111\u1EB7c tr\u01B0ng cho nhi\u1EC5m Chlamydia trachomatis serovar L1, L2, L3."
