          "Staphylococcus aureus l\xE0 t\xE1c nh\xE2n g\xE2y b\u1EC7nh h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u trong chi; ph\xE2n l\u1EADp t\u1EEB b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 b\u1EC7nh ph\u1EA9m n\xE0o \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 \xFD ngh\u0129a l\xE2m s\xE0ng.",
          "S. aureus ti\u1EBFt nhi\u1EC1u y\u1EBFu t\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EF1c: Protein A (kh\xE1ng th\u1EF1c b\xE0o b\u1EB1ng g\u1EAFn \u0111o\u1EA1n Fc c\u1EE7a IgG), TSST-1, Exfoliatin A&B (SSSS/b\u1EC7nh Ritter), enterotoxin A-E (ng\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED9c th\u1EE9c \u0103n b\u1EC1n nhi\u1EC7t), v\xE0 PVL (ho\u1EA1i t\u1EED da, ph\u1ED5i \u1EDF CA-MRSA).",
